# Line endings are pinned, not left to each machine's core.autocrlf.
#
# The suites hash and byte-count real files, and the screen saver's ini records
# paths, so "the same commit gives the same bytes" is a property this repo
# actually relies on. Windows defaults to autocrlf=true, which rewrites the
# working copy on checkout and makes that property false.
#
# LF for everything, including the PowerShell and C# sources: both the Windows
# PowerShell 5.1 parser and the in-box C# compiler accept LF, and the build
# scripts in this repo are already LF on the author's machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Real binaries. Without these, `text=auto` may still decide a font is text and
# rewrite bytes inside it.
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.m4v  binary
*.scr binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
